Third-party data

Space weather observations and forecast products are obtained from NOAA /
NWS Space Weather Prediction Center (SWPC) public data services:

  https://www.swpc.noaa.gov/
  https://services.swpc.noaa.gov/

Users should consult NOAA/SWPC for official forecasts and warnings.

