Third-party software

This project depends on open-source packages listed in package.json and
pnpm-lock.yaml (MIT, Apache-2.0, and other licenses as declared by each
package). Notable runtime dependencies include:

  - React (MIT)
  - Three.js (MIT)
  - @react-three/fiber, @react-three/drei, @react-three/postprocessing (MIT)
  - postprocessing (MIT / zlib-style as declared upstream)
  - Zustand (MIT)
  - TanStack Query (MIT)
  - Vite, Tailwind CSS (MIT)

GLSL simplex noise routines used in the aurora shader are based on well-known
public-domain / permissive implementations associated with Ashima Arts and
Ian McEwan (commonly redistributed with credit).

See each package’s LICENSE file under node_modules for full terms.
